# One line ending for every text file in the repository: LF.
#
# Before this file the repository held 718 LF files, 536 CRLF and 3 that mixed
# both, so the same one-line edit produced a whole-file diff depending on which
# editor or tool last touched the file. With this, Git stores LF whatever the
# working copy has, so a Windows editor saving CRLF cannot churn a diff again.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never interpret these as text.
*.pdf  binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.webp binary
*.tif  binary
*.tiff binary
*.ico  binary
